    "q-215477": {
      "dom_id": "step-q215477",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Solve the absolute value inequality $|\\frac{1}{4}-x|<\\frac{7}{4}.$\n\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}\n$x$\n{{field-3}}\n$2$",
      "worked_solution": "We convert the absolute value inequality into a compound inequality to remove the absolute value. \n\nThe inequality specifies every number $\\frac{1}{4}-x$ whose distance from zero is less than $\\frac{7}{4}.$ This corresponds to the following compound inequality:\n\n$$\n-\\frac{7}{4}<\\frac{1}{4}-x<\\frac{7}{4}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve the compound inequality using the usual methods. (Remember that whenever we multiply or divide by a negative number, we have to flip the inequality signs.)\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{7}{4}<\\frac{1}{4}-x & <\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ -2<-x & <\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 2>x & >-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo make the final result easier to read, we will rewrite it so that the smaller number is on the left:\n\n$$\n-\\frac{3}{2}<x<2\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:35px;\n                                        margin-left:8px;\n                                        margin-right:3px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"15\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"21\" class=\"\">−</span><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"23\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"25\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"24\">3</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"27\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"26\">2</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "−32​",
